{"title": "Thunderous Acuity", "pageid": 28328, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Thunderous_Acuity", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Thunderous Acuity</b> is a passive feature that improves the wearer's spell power after dealing thunder damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Whenever the wearer deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage, they gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Acuity_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Acuity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Acuity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Acuity_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Acuity (Condition)\">Arcane Acuity</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Arcane_Acuity\"> Condition: Arcane Acuity </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Acuity_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Acuity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Acuity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Arcane_Acuity_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Acuity_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Acuity (Condition)\">Arcane Acuity</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has a +1 bonus to its <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">spell</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw#The_Difficulty_Class_of_saving_throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">spell save DC</a> for each remaining turn.</li>\n<li>Reduce the duration by 2 each time the entity takes damage.</li>\n<li><b>Arcane Acuity</b> has a maximum <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10 turns.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hat_of_Storm_Scion%27s_Power\" title=\"Hat of Storm Scion's Power\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Wizard_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Wizard_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Wizard_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Wizard_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Wizard_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Wizard_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Wizard_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Wizard_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Wizard_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hat_of_Storm_Scion%27s_Power\" title=\"Hat of Storm Scion's Power\">Hat of Storm Scion's Power</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage must directly originate from the wearer, so conditions like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Singing_Sword:_Shrieking_(Condition)\" title=\"Singing Sword: Shrieking (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Singing_Sword_Shriek_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Singing_Sword_Shriek_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Singing_Sword_Shriek_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Singing_Sword_Shriek_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Singing_Sword_Shriek_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Singing_Sword_Shriek_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Singing Sword: Shrieking\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Singing_Sword_Shriek_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Singing_Sword_Shriek_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Singing_Sword_Shriek_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Singing_Sword:_Shrieking_(Condition)\" title=\"Singing Sword: Shrieking (Condition)\">Singing Sword: Shrieking</a> (outside of Honour mode) and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage caused by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reverberation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\">Reverberation</a> does not trigger the passive.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Though not stated, Thunderous Acuity only functions once per attack and applies 2 turns of Arcane Acuity.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195209\nCache expiry: 86400\